MySQL: the original MySQL functions (mysql_connect, mysql_query, ...),
deprecated since PHP 5.5 and removed in PHP 7.0, through mysqlnd. With
php56-mysqlnd; php56-mysql-openssl is the same for
php56-mysqlnd-openssl.

The module mysql of PHP 5.6 for php56 of azsupport/ports,
which installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20131226/mysql.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php56/conf.d,
its headers in include/php56/php/ext/mysql.
